    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Caster level 1st or higher with at least two casting traditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Choose two in any combination of magic talents and base spheres that you possess. You may use these spheres and talents as if they were part of all casting traditions you possess.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat multiple times, each time selecting two different magic talents or base spheres.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
